#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:109
msgid ""
"**Manually created networks** are defined directly in |morpheus| and are "
"used when the Cloud does not auto-discover networks (e.g., HVM clusters "
"where networks are defined by Virtual Switch segments) or when you need "
"to create an overlay network definition."
