#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:176
msgid "Advanced Options (Search Domains)"
msgstr "Advanced Opciones (Search Dominios)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:178
msgid ""
"Search domains are appended to DNS searches when a **non** fully "
"qualified domain name (short name) is queried.  Search domains can be "
"entered as comma separated values, which will be added to DNS "
"configurations, such as `/etc/resolv.conf` These domains are injected via"
" cloud-init or other method chosen for the virtual image."
msgstr ""
"Search domains son appended a DNS searches cuando un **non** fully "
"qualified domain nombre (corto nombre) es queried.  Search domains puede "
"be entered como comma separated valores, cual será be agregado a DNS "
"configurations, como `/etc/resolv.conf` Estos domains son injected via "
"cloud-init o otro método chosen para el imagen virtual."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:182
msgid "Group and Tenant Access"
msgstr "Grupo y Inquilino Acceso"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:184
msgid ""
"Networks can be configured to provide specific Group and Tenant access, "
"if desired. **Group Access** controls which Groups at provision time will"
" have access to the Network resource. Only workloads being provisioned to"
" the selected Groups would have visibility into the Network. Workloads "
"provisioned to other Groups would not see the Network as an available "
"selection. **Tenant Permissions** control which Tenants may see the "
"Network. Public visibility allows access to the Network for users in all "
"Tenants (subject to additional RBAC controls) while Private visibility "
"allows access only for selected Tenants. Select all that may apply."
msgstr ""
"Redes se puede configurar a proporcionar específico Grupo y Inquilino "
"acceso, si se desea. **Grupo Acceso** controls cual Grupos en provision "
"tiempo será tienen acceso al Red recurso. Solo cargas de trabajo being "
"aprovisionado al seleccionado Grupos would tienen visibility en el Red. "
"Cargas de trabajo aprovisionado a otro Grupos would no consulte la Red "
"como un disponible selection. **Inquilino Permisos** control cual "
"Inquilinos puede consulte la Red. Público visibility permite acceso al "
"Red para usuarios en todos Inquilinos (subject a adicional RBAC controls)"
" mientras Privado visibility permite acceso solo para seleccionado "
"Inquilinos. Seleccionar todos ese puede apply."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:187
msgid "Guest Console SSH Tunnel"
msgstr "Guest Console SSH Tunnel"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/networks.rst:189
msgid ""
"In some scenarios, instances that are segregated from the |morpheus| "
"appliance by port restrictions, or other mechanisms, can cause "
"difficulties to access the guest console via the |morpheus| web UI. Guest"
" Console SSH Tunnel settings allow the administrator to configure a jump "
"host's settings that is dual-homed, accessible by |morpheus| but also "
"resides on the segregated network. When the guest console is configured "
"with the SSH protocol, the traffic will be routed to the jump host, which"
" will then relay to the target instance."
msgstr ""
"En algunos scenarios, instances ese son segregated desde el |morpheus| "
"appliance por puerto restrictions, o otro mechanisms, puede cause "
"difficulties a acceso el guest console via el |morpheus| web UI. Guest "
"Console SSH Tunnel configuraciones permitir el administrator a configure "
"un jump host's configuraciones ese es dual-homed, accessible por "
"|morpheus| pero también resides en el segregated network. Cuando el guest"
" console está configurado con el SSH protocolo, el traffic será be routed"
" al jump host, cual será entonces relay al destino instance."

